1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Team Nabeghlavi presents Outpost 30 for the NASA Space Apps challenge “Build a Junior Astronaut Mission Trainer”.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Each sol replays a real NASA day. On 18 January 2026, NASA DONKI logged an X1.9 solar flare.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The same day, NASA’s SOHO observatory detected a particle storm near Earth. Storm shelter costs 8 kWh and a card tomorrow.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
We pay 8 kWh: the storm takes 1.2 mSv of Shield instead of 4. Sunset shows the cost. No choice is free.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
13 NASA and CSA datasets, each with its source link. Space weather is live when online, and says so.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Play free in any browser, no account needed. Pick Cadet or Commander, then scan the code or open the link.
